    <string name="calibration_instruction_pull_up">Hang from the bar with straight arms and stay still. After the countdown: one pull-up until your chin is over the bar, then hang all the way down again.</string>
    <string name="calibration_instruction_push_up">Get into the push-up position with straight arms, face above the phone. After the countdown: one push-up, then stay at the top.</string>
    <string name="calibration_instruction_squat">Toes just behind the phone, then keep still; you can look wherever you like. After the countdown: one squat, then stand up straight again.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_no_face">No face detected. Check light and position: your face has to be right above the phone.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_no_person">No person detected. Check light and position: your shoulders have to be above the camera and in the picture.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_too_weak">The movement was too weak in the signal. Keep your face right above the phone; for pull-ups put the phone directly under the bar.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_low_contrast">The picture hardly got darker during the squat. Keep your toes right behind the phone; a bright ceiling light above you helps, a bright top on a bright ceiling does not.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_no_return">The movement was detected but the start position was not reached again. Please start and end in the start position.</string>
    <string name="calibration_failure_implausible_duration">The rep took %1$s s. Plausible is %2$s–%3$s s. Please repeat at a normal pace.</string>

